                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "The crosswind carried your scent up the shelf a full switchback before I laid eyes on you. My Altaria smelled the storm you are walking into. Settle it here first."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "You have the bearing of the old Keep photographs - the ones the Company keeps torching. I will not ask. My Noibat will."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Every wing on this ridge answers to the wind, and the wind saw you coming. So did I. Battle me or pay the toll and climb on."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Lyra Stormflight",
                    Label: "default"
                }
